choice("Continue", B3-Ch02a-Rubble, v_current_scene = B3-Ch02a-Rubble) if (v_reflexes == 4 && v_b3_ch1_unlock != 2)


ID: B3-Ch02a-Speed
TEXT:

set(v_is_dead,1) if (v_b3_ch1_unlock == 2 || v_agility < 4)
set(v_is_dead,0) if (v_agility == 4 && v_b3_ch1_unlock != 2)
#if(v_b3_ch1_unlock == 2 || v_agility < 4) {
 "I'll go distract some of the golems," I say. "Push for the gatehouse. I will regroup at the threshold."

I pull my crossbow, slip past the edge of Daren's barrier, and sprint across the gravel verge. I keep wide of the ditch to stay outside the archers' primary kill zone, drawing the constructs' focus on the ground.

I loose three bolts against the nearest iron hulls. The points snap against the reinforced steel, but the impact draws their heads around. Three sets of jaws unhinge, and three torrents of fire sweep across the dirt.

I sprint and weave in erratic zigzags, but raw leg speed without sufficient enhancement cannot outrun three sweeping flame channels on open ground. The fire engulfs me, searing flesh to ash before I can reach cover.

}
#if(v_agility == 4 && v_b3_ch1_unlock != 2) {
 "I'll go distract some of the golems," I say. "Push for the gatehouse. I will regroup at the threshold."

I pull my crossbow, slip past the edge of Daren's barrier, and sprint across the gravel verge. I keep wide of the ditch to stay outside the archers' primary kill zone, drawing the constructs' focus on the ground.

I loose three bolts against the nearest iron hulls. The points snap against the reinforced steel, but the impact draws their heads around. Three sets of jaws unhinge, and three torrents of fire sweep across the dirt.

Enhanced speed turns the gravel into a blur under my boots. I cut hard angles, accelerating through the smoke to stay ahead of the tracking beams. Hadrik shatters the gate sentry and wades into the ditch, slamming a crushing fist into the nearest construct and breaking its channel.

Glancing toward the entrance, I see Daren's barrier advancing rapidly toward the portal. Above, Illuna washes the archers from the parapet, allowing Kate to channel a massive frost lance in the sky, reinforcing the projectile to punch through anti-magic plating.

Kate drives her hand down. The frost lance screams through the air, punching cleanly through the chest of the second golem targeting me and pinning the carcass to the ditch bank. Hadrik crushes his fourth target an instant later.

Heavy stomping vibrates through the valley. A dozen more iron golems from the outer patrol rings are closing in fast, their chest vents glowing as they prepare to fire. Hadrik engages the closest, while the last active beam pivots toward Flower and Illuna in the sky.

Daren reaches the broken archway and yells back across the rubble.

"Fall back to the gate!" he roars. "Disengage and move! Before the second wave locks us down!"

}
